  "status": "hand",
  "note": "Group pages: every registry name <group><n> is one variant shown on its group page (e.g. button1..button27 on /components/button, hero1..hero14 on /blocks/marketing/hero-sections, chart1..chart20 on /blocks/dashboard-ui/charts, dashboard-modal1..28 on /blocks/dashboard-ui/modal-dialogs, illustration1..28 on /illustrations), so the rewrite maps each name to its group page path (from the site's own registry href fields) and the single template fills it; a click lands on the page that shows the variant (anchors #<group>-<n> are not used). stat-card1..4 exist twice in the registry (/blocks/dashboard-ui/stat-cards and /examples/cards/stat) and the catalog merges them; all stat-card items point to /blocks/dashboard-ui/stat-cards. No item is expected to stay url-less. Pages: 200 = group page, 404 = miss."
